{"seq":3,"slug":"nursing","title":"护理学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"护理学-简介\">护理学 简介</h1><p>护理学是以促进健康、预防疾病、恢复健康和减轻痛苦为目标的应用学科，它关注的不仅是疾病本身，更是患病过程中人的整体需求。从基本的生命体征监测到复杂的危重症护理，从手术前后的身体照护到患者心理状态的关怀支持，护理学构建了一套以患者为中心的系统化照护知识体系。</p>\n<p>自学者进入护理学领域时会发现，这门学科有着独特的人文关怀维度。医学关注的是&quot;治愈疾病&quot;，护理学关注的则是&quot;照护患者&quot;——这两者之间存在微妙但重要的区别。很多疾病无法完全治愈，但患者始终需要高质量的护理来维持生活质量和精神尊严。护理学正是在这种&quot;照护&quot;的理念基础上，发展出了自己的理论框架和实践方法。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>护理学基础</strong>介绍护理学的理论基石和基本操作技能，建立对护理专业的整体认知。第二章<strong>临床护理</strong>涵盖内外科、妇儿科和精神科护理等主要临床方向，这是护理实践的核心内容。第三章<strong>社区护理</strong>关注医院之外的健康服务，包括公共卫生护理、家庭照护和健康教育。第四章<strong>护理研究</strong>介绍循证护理、护理信息学和质量改进等方法，帮助理解如何用科学方法持续提升护理实践的质量。</p>\n<p>建议在学习时注重将医学知识和护理思维结合——理解疾病的病理生理是基础，但护理学的独特价值在于始终从患者整体需求的角度出发，而不是仅仅关注疾病指标的改善。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nursing-foundations","title":"护理学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/nursing-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nursing-theory","title":"大学护理学 — 护理理论与护理模式","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/nursing-foundations/nursing-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"health-assessment","title":"大学护理学 — 健康评估","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/nursing-foundations/health-assessment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"basic-nursing-skills","title":"大学护理学 — 基础护理技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/nursing-foundations/basic-nursing-skills"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"clinical-nursing","title":"临床护理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/clinical-nursing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"medical-nursing","title":"大学护理学 — 内科护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/clinical-nursing/medical-nursing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"surgical-nursing","title":"大学护理学 — 外科护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/clinical-nursing/surgical-nursing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pediatric-nursing","title":"大学护理学 — 儿科护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/clinical-nursing/pediatric-nursing"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"community-nursing","title":"社区护理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/community-nursing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"primary-care","title":"大学护理学 — 初级卫生保健与社区护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/community-nursing/primary-care"},{"seq":2,"slug":"public-health-nursing","title":"大学护理学 — 公共卫生护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/community-nursing/public-health-nursing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"geriatric-nursing","title":"大学护理学 — 老年护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/community-nursing/geriatric-nursing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"nursing-research","title":"护理研究","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/nursing-research","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"research-methodology","title":"大学护理学 — 护理研究方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/nursing-research/research-methodology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"evidence-based-nursing","title":"大学护理学 — 循证护理实践","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/nursing-research/evidence-based-nursing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"nursing-informatics","title":"大学护理学 — 护理信息学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/nursing-research/nursing-informatics"}]}]}